embeded-midi-synth — fixed-point General MIDI wavetable synthesis engine
=========================================================================

Upstream: https://github.com/xrip/embeded-midi-synth
Author:   xrip

Files vendored here (verbatim from upstream; engine from the mulaw-analysis
branch — v5 banks store PCM as 8-bit G.711 µ-law, ~half the size of int16):
  - wavetable.c.inl   (the fixed-point synthesis engine)
  - gm_bank.h         (packed GM sound-bank blob format + validation, v5)
  - wt_luts.h         (baked fixed-point lookup tables)
  - mulaw.h           (G.711 µ-law codec + decode LUT)

