-----------------------------------------------------------
This engine plays a pre-packed General MIDI sound bank ("gm_bank.bin").
No sound bank is included in this repository or in pico-spec firmware.

Microsoft's "gm.dls" (shipped with Windows) and any gm_bank.bin derived
from it are copyrighted and NOT redistributable. You may pack your own
legally-owned gm.dls into a gm_bank.bin for your own SD card, but you
must NOT commit it to a public repository or ship it inside firmware.

For a redistributable bank, use an open-licensed source such as the
"freepats" GUS patch set (see upstream docs/usage.md, gus_pack).
